  "annotations": {
    "architecture": "OP-XY stereo output splits into a direct stereo path and a mono-to-stereo 100% wet reverb path. Dry Wet Mix crossfades those paths directly from CC 2, preserving the proven on-device Mix response.",
    "midi": "MIDI channel 1, CC 2 is hardware-calibrated with strength raw 21845: approximately 33% controller travel produces approximately 33% Dry Wet Mix. The same calibrated CC drives Wash Macro; HPF reaches approximately 17 kHz at 80% travel and reverb decay reaches infinity at approximately 80% travel.",
    "hardwareStatus": "Experimental: compiler validation does not verify this Patch on Euroburo hardware.",
    "routing": "Connect OP-XY L/R directly to Euroburo inputs and Euroburo outputs directly to the monitoring or downstream device; do not return through an NTS-4 parallel send/return mix for total washout."
  },
